Modifications (GPL-3.0 section 5a)
----------------------------------
Modified from LinusCDE/chessmarkable by Aayush Bajaj, April–July 2026:
- Display backend: libremarkable framebuffer -> QTFB shared-memory protocol.
- Chess engine: pleco (x86-only) -> shakmaty (pure Rust, aarch64).
- Architecture: armv7 (gnueabihf) -> aarch64 (musl, static).
- RGB colour board for the Gallery 3 e-ink panel; interactive pawn-promotion UI.
- Packaged as a standalone rm-appload (AppLoad) application.
- Paper Pro Move build (--features move): native 954-px-wide layout, scaled
  buttons and dialogs.

